WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.266
By the end, your form is switched on, and you've got the link to send to contractors.

2
00:00:05.266 --> 00:00:05.940
Five steps.

3
00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.428
Google makes you switch the form on by hand, once.

4
00:00:10.428 --> 00:00:12.819
Click Extensions, then Apps Script:

5
00:00:12.819 --> 00:00:14.480
that's the form's engine.

6
00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:18.075
A new tab opens.

7
00:00:18.075 --> 00:00:21.634
Top right, click Deploy, then New deployment.

8
00:00:21.634 --> 00:00:23.800
Deploy just means switch on.

9
00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.896
Click the gear, and pick Web app.

10
00:00:26.896 --> 00:00:29.200
That turns the form into a web page.

11
00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:31.295
Execute as:

12
00:00:31.295 --> 00:00:33.165
Me, so it runs as you.

13
00:00:33.165 --> 00:00:34.465
Who has access:

14
00:00:34.465 --> 00:00:37.797
Anyone, so every contractor can open it.

15
00:00:37.797 --> 00:00:39.260
Then click Deploy.

16
00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:43.989
If Google asks again, Allow, like before.

17
00:00:43.989 --> 00:00:45.660
Then close that tab.

18
00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:47.971
Back in your Sheet:

19
00:00:47.971 --> 00:00:50.286
Contractor intake, then Check again.

20
00:00:50.286 --> 00:00:52.100
It checks every line for you.

21
00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:56.532
Give it a few seconds.

22
00:00:56.532 --> 00:00:59.752
When it says Everything is ready, your form is on.

23
00:00:59.752 --> 00:01:00.320
Click OK.

24
00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:04.095
Last step.

25
00:01:04.095 --> 00:01:06.560
On the Setup tab, scroll down to Links.

26
00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:09.577
That's your form's address:

27
00:01:09.577 --> 00:01:11.418
Link to send to contractors.

28
00:01:11.418 --> 00:01:12.560
Send that one out.

29
00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:15.573
Want an email when someone signs up?

30
00:01:15.573 --> 00:01:17.440
Open the menu and hit Email alerts.

31
00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:20.200
Type your address,

32
00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:24.280
Two people? Add both, up to 5. Example: josh@example.com, assistant@example.com (comma between them)

33
00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:26.601
then say yes or no to each one:

34
00:01:26.601 --> 00:01:30.060
sign-ups, a daily summary, problems, replies.

35
00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:33.559
Click No on the test email.

36
00:01:33.559 --> 00:01:35.987
Then your alerts show here as ON.

37
00:01:35.987 --> 00:01:38.200
Change them anytime, same menu.

38
00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:40.341
That's part two.

39
00:01:40.341 --> 00:01:43.400
Your form is on, and you've got your contractor link.
